Third-party content

The files below hold content from public web pages: snapshots of each page, frozen for
regression testing of the extraction pipeline (test/), and the seed eval's WebFetch output for
its five pages (usage/seed/runs/*/W.md). Each belongs to its publisher, on the publisher's terms;
this project's MIT license does not cover it. To have a page removed, open an issue in this
repository.

The web app's home page shows an excerpt of test/fixtures/vitepress-vue-computed.html (vuejs.org,
CC BY 4.0), with its attribution.

